    "markdown": "# MIT OCW: Game Design (Spring 2014)\n\n## 基本信息\n\n- 作者：Philip B. Tan / Richard Eberhardt\n- 年份：2014\n- 类型：course\n- 来源：MIT OpenCourseWare\n\n## 摘要\n\nMIT 的非数字游戏设计课，覆盖单机制、体验与美学、Perspective 以及规则写作规范。\n\n## 核心要点\n\n- 对规则表达非常有帮助。\n- 适合把体验目标转回具体机制。\n- 规则写作规范能直接用于项目文档质量提升。\n\n## 适用场景\n\n适合用来重写玩法规则、可读性规范和规则说明文档。\n\n## 分类\n\n- 一级分类：核心玩法与系统设计\n- 二级输出物：单机制原型设计\n- 主题标签：设计基础 / 规则与形式化 / 试玩与迭代\n- 可用性：已下载开放全文\n\n## 获取方式\n\n- 已有本地文件，可直接打开。\n\n## 本地文件\n\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/open-web/mit-ocw-2014/assignment-one-single-mechanic.pdf`\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/open-web/mit-ocw-2014/assignment-three-perspective.pdf`\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/open-web/mit-ocw-2014/assignment-two-experience-and-aesthetics.pdf`\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/open-web/mit-ocw-2014/journey-to-the-top-of-the-world.pdf`\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/open-web/mit-ocw-2014/mutiny.pdf`\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/open-web/mit-ocw-2014/roman-conquest-the-first-triumvirate.pdf`\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/open-web/mit-ocw-2014/technicality.pdf`\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/open-web/mit-ocw-2014/written-rules-style-guide.pdf`\n\n## 官方链接\n\n- <https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/cms-608-game-design-spring-2014/>\n\n## 元数据快照\n\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/official-metadata/mit-ocw-2014-game-design/01-ocw.mit.edu-courses-cms-608-game-design-spring-2014-.html`\n\n## 相关条目\n\n- Rules of Play\n- Game Design Workshop\n",
