    "markdown": "# Game Feel: A Game Designer's Guide to Virtual Sensation vs Level Up! The Guide to Great Video Game Design\n\n> Use Game Feel to diagnose response quality and feedback timing, then use Level Up to express the resulting work as production-ready tasks and specs.\n\n## Comparison Axis\n\n- moment-to-moment sensation vs production-facing implementation language\n\n## Game Feel: A Game Designer's Guide to Virtual Sensation 更强在什么地方\n\n- 打击感诊断\n- 操作响应优化\n- 体验层问题拆解\n- 诊断框架\n- Use when: The game works mechanically, but movement, combat, or interaction still feels dead or muddy.\n\n## Level Up! The Guide to Great Video Game Design 更强在什么地方\n\n- spec 写作\n- 交付物表达\n- 跨职能沟通\n- 落地模板\n- Use when: The team understands the problem but needs concrete documentation, task framing, and implementation-facing language.\n\n## 如何一起使用\n\n- Let Game Feel define the sensory diagnosis, then let Level Up translate it into deliverables for the team.\n\n## Game Feel: A Game Designer's Guide to Virtual Sensation 的结构证据\n\n- Game Feel: A Game Designer’s Guide to Virtual Sensation (p.4)\n- Acknowledgments (p.10)\n- Introduction (p.14)\n- About This Book (p.15)\n- Chapter 1. Defining Game Feel (p.20)\n\n## Level Up! The Guide to Great Video Game Design 的结构证据\n\n- Level Up!: The Guide to Great Video Game Design\n",
    "html": "<h1 id=\"game-feel-a-game-designers-guide-to-virtual-sensation-vs-level-up-the-guide-to-great-video-game-design\">Game Feel: A Game Designer&#39;s Guide to Virtual Sensation vs Level Up! The Guide to Great Video Game Design</h1>\n<blockquote>Use Game Feel to diagnose response quality and feedback timing, then use Level Up to express the resulting work as production-ready tasks and specs.</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"comparison-axis\">Comparison Axis</h2>\n<ul><li>moment-to-moment sensation vs production-facing implementation language</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"game-feel-a-game-designers-guide-to-virtual-sensation-更强在什么地方\">Game Feel: A Game Designer&#39;s Guide to Virtual Sensation 更强在什么地方</h2>\n<ul><li>打击感诊断</li><li>操作响应优化</li><li>体验层问题拆解</li><li>诊断框架</li><li>Use when: The game works mechanically, but movement, combat, or interaction still feels dead or muddy.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"level-up-the-guide-to-great-video-game-design-更强在什么地方\">Level Up! The Guide to Great Video Game Design 更强在什么地方</h2>\n<ul><li>spec 写作</li><li>交付物表达</li><li>跨职能沟通</li><li>落地模板</li><li>Use when: The team understands the problem but needs concrete documentation, task framing, and implementation-facing language.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"如何一起使用\">如何一起使用</h2>\n<ul><li>Let Game Feel define the sensory diagnosis, then let Level Up translate it into deliverables for the team.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"game-feel-a-game-designers-guide-to-virtual-sensation-的结构证据\">Game Feel: A Game Designer&#39;s Guide to Virtual Sensation 的结构证据</h2>\n<ul><li>Game Feel: A Game Designer’s Guide to Virtual Sensation (p.4)</li><li>Acknowledgments (p.10)</li><li>Introduction (p.14)</li><li>About This Book (p.15)</li><li>Chapter 1. Defining Game Feel (p.20)</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"level-up-the-guide-to-great-video-game-design-的结构证据\">Level Up! The Guide to Great Video Game Design 的结构证据</h2>\n<ul><li>Level Up!: The Guide to Great Video Game Design</li></ul>"
