    "markdown": "# Rules of Play vs The Game Design Reader: A Rules of Play Anthology\n\n> Use Rules of Play to establish common design language, then use The Game Design Reader to widen that language with criticism, history, and case-driven context.\n\n## Comparison Axis\n\n- core design framework vs anthology of critical and historical context\n\n## Rules of Play 更强在什么地方\n\n- 术语统一\n- 规则审查\n- 设计写作支撑\n- 基础框架\n- Use when: The team needs a stable framework for rules, systems, play, and meaning.\n\n## The Game Design Reader: A Rules of Play Anthology 更强在什么地方\n\n- 高层设计审查\n- 理论补课\n- 阅读小组共读\n- 跨书目比较\n- Use when: The team needs broader theoretical range, critical context, or shared reading for deeper design discussion.\n\n## 如何一起使用\n\n- Anchor the vocabulary with Rules of Play, then use the anthology to test and expand the team's conceptual range.\n\n## Rules of Play 的结构证据\n\n- 这本书当前没有提取出足够强的 TOC anchors，优先参考它的 work 条目和 evidence note。\n\n## The Game Design Reader: A Rules of Play Anthology 的结构证据\n\n- 这本书当前没有提取出足够强的 TOC anchors，优先参考它的 work 条目和 evidence note。\n",
    "html": "<h1 id=\"rules-of-play-vs-the-game-design-reader-a-rules-of-play-anthology\">Rules of Play vs The Game Design Reader: A Rules of Play Anthology</h1>\n<blockquote>Use Rules of Play to establish common design language, then use The Game Design Reader to widen that language with criticism, history, and case-driven context.</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"comparison-axis\">Comparison Axis</h2>\n<ul><li>core design framework vs anthology of critical and historical context</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"rules-of-play-更强在什么地方\">Rules of Play 更强在什么地方</h2>\n<ul><li>术语统一</li><li>规则审查</li><li>设计写作支撑</li><li>基础框架</li><li>Use when: The team needs a stable framework for rules, systems, play, and meaning.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"the-game-design-reader-a-rules-of-play-anthology-更强在什么地方\">The Game Design Reader: A Rules of Play Anthology 更强在什么地方</h2>\n<ul><li>高层设计审查</li><li>理论补课</li><li>阅读小组共读</li><li>跨书目比较</li><li>Use when: The team needs broader theoretical range, critical context, or shared reading for deeper design discussion.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"如何一起使用\">如何一起使用</h2>\n<ul><li>Anchor the vocabulary with Rules of Play, then use the anthology to test and expand the team&#39;s conceptual range.</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"rules-of-play-的结构证据\">Rules of Play 的结构证据</h2>\n<ul><li>这本书当前没有提取出足够强的 TOC anchors，优先参考它的 work 条目和 evidence note。</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"the-game-design-reader-a-rules-of-play-anthology-的结构证据\">The Game Design Reader: A Rules of Play Anthology 的结构证据</h2>\n<ul><li>这本书当前没有提取出足够强的 TOC anchors，优先参考它的 work 条目和 evidence note。</li></ul>"
