    "markdown": "# The Art of Game Design: A Book of Lenses：Concept Seeds\n\n## 可继续长成卡片的概念种子\n\n- table of lenses\n- HELLO\n- In the Beginning, There Is the Designer\n- The Designer Creates an Experience\n- The Experience Takes Place in a Venue\n- The Experience Rises Out of a Game\n- The Game Consists of Elements\n- The Elements Support a Theme\n- The Game Begins with an Idea\n- The Game Improves through Iteration\n\n## 这本书最可能回答的问题\n\n- 最适合在立项、方向收敛、设计评审、vertical slice 复盘和跨职能沟通时使用，而不是把它当成某一个单独系统的详细教程。\n- 围绕“高层方向收敛”去检索相关章节和证据。\n- 围绕“设计评审”去检索相关章节和证据。\n- 围绕“跨团队对齐”去检索相关章节和证据。\n- 围绕“问题清单构建”去检索相关章节和证据。\n\n## AI 引用建议\n\n- 先把相关章节标题和你的项目问题一起给模型，而不是笼统地说“参考整本书”。\n- 如果需要更稳的回答，优先同时引用这本书的 `book entry`、`chapter map note` 和这张 `concept seeds` 卡。\n\n## Evidence Anchors\n\n- table of lenses (p.29)\n- Acknowledgments (p.37)\n- HELLO (p.39)\n- Chapter 1: In the Beginning, There Is the Designer (p.47)\n- Chapter 2: The Designer Creates an Experience (p.55)\n- Chapter 3: The Experience Takes Place in a Venue (p.71)\n",
