    "markdown": "# MIT OCW: Introduction to Game Design Methods (Spring 2016)\n\n## 基本信息\n\n- 作者：Mikael Jakobsson / Sara Verrilli\n- 年份：2016\n- 类型：course\n- 来源：MIT OpenCourseWare\n\n## 摘要\n\nMIT 的方法论课程材料，包含 board game analysis、research、pitch、paper prototyping 和 playtest 等完整作业链。\n\n## 核心要点\n\n- 非常适合把知识库转成训练流程。\n- 能直接沉淀成 prompt 和检查单。\n- 对“做完一个原型后怎么验证”特别有帮助。\n\n## 适用场景\n\n最适合用于制作原型验证、试玩记录和审查模板。\n\n## 分类\n\n- 一级分类：测试、验收与审计\n- 二级输出物：回归测试检查单\n- 主题标签：试玩与迭代 / 设计基础 / 项目审计\n- 可用性：已下载开放全文\n\n## 获取方式\n\n- 已有本地文件，可直接打开。\n\n## 本地文件\n\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/open-web/mit-ocw-2016/assignment-1-people-in-my-life-through-games.pdf`\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/open-web/mit-ocw-2016/assignment-2-board-game-analysis-solution.pdf`\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/open-web/mit-ocw-2016/assignment-2-board-game-analysis.pdf`\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/open-web/mit-ocw-2016/assignment-3-scrabbleship-working-with-game-mechanics.pdf`\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/open-web/mit-ocw-2016/assignment-4-research.pdf`\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/open-web/mit-ocw-2016/assignment-5-game-design-document-and-pitch.pdf`\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/open-web/mit-ocw-2016/assignment-6-paper-prototyping.pdf`\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/open-web/mit-ocw-2016/assignment-7-playtest.pdf`\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/open-web/mit-ocw-2016/assignment-8-explorative-game-design-project.pdf`\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/open-web/mit-ocw-2016/assignment-8-step-4-oral-presentation-and-written-report.pdf`\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/open-web/mit-ocw-2016/high-level-design-template.pdf`\n\n## 官方链接\n\n- <https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/cms-301-introduction-to-game-design-methods-spring-2016/>\n\n## 元数据快照\n\n- `knowledge/50-game-design-masters-kb/raw/official-metadata/mit-ocw-2016-introduction-to-game-design-methods/01-ocw.mit.edu-courses-cms-301-introduction-to-game-design-methods-spring-2016-.html`\n\n## 相关条目\n\n- Game Design Concepts\n- Game Design Workshop\n",
